  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>As a Magic action, present your holy symbol and choose one creature within 30 feet. The target makes a Wisdom saving throw. On a failure, it is wracked by whispered pain for 1 minute. Once on each of your turns when the target takes damage, you may force it to speak one true sentence about a fear, guilt, secret, or hidden allegiance. The target can repeat the save at the end of each of its turns.</p>",
